---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1)
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="lua-cta-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-card glass-card">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <span class="cta-badge">Información, Pilotos y Demostraciones</span>
        <h2 class="cta-title">¿Quieres llevar a Lúa y sus 6 mundos STEAM a tu centro o al hogar?</h2>
        <p class="cta-description">
          Si formas parte de una escuela infantil (0–6 años), centro de atención temprana, consulta de logopedia u ORL pediátrica, hospital o fondo de inversión en salud digital, y deseas conocer de cerca la unidad electrónica sellada de Lúa, los sets de bloques de <strong>Construye con Lúa</strong> (EN 71-1) o el bloque háptico Ronroneo, contacta directamente con el Dr. Frank Betances.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-open-contact>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Contactar con el Dr. Frank Betances</span>
          </button>
          <a href={`${baseUrl}/construye-con-lua`} class="btn btn-secondary">
            <span>Explorar Lúa Construye</span>
          </a>
          <a href={`${baseUrl}/descubre-con-lua`} class="btn btn-secondary">
            <span>Descubre con Lúa (Aula)</span>
          </a>
          <a href={`${baseUrl}/`} class="btn btn-secondary">
            <span>Conoce Valeria+</span>
          </a>
          <a href={`${baseUrl}/earlify`} class="btn btn-secondary">
            <span>Ecosistema Earlify Health</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lua-cta-section {
    padding: 40px 0 100px 0;
  }

  .cta-card {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85) 60%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 4rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .cta-content {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .cta-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
    color: #fb923c;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cta-description {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    border: none;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #fb923c 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.6);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cta-card {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
